<mxCell id="uc_n_91" value="Every actor uses the single UC01 Log in, which always includes UC02 (server-side redirect by role from the database). Clients see only UC23 and their own A4 notices in UC20; they never receive SMS. Admin has no project-editing use cases beyond UC06 set-up and assignments." style="html=1;shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1740" y="260" width="420" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
